&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Individuals who can logically structure their thoughts and communicate effectively&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Individuals who can approach everything with a strong sense of ownership&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;ものごとを論理的に組み立ててコミュニケーションが取れる方&lt;/li&gt;
