&lt;div class=&quot;col-sm-9 col-12 content&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Description&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;PayPay is looking for a Cloud Platform Engineer for PayPay&#39;s Cloud Based payment system. This role will be responsible for the engineering of Cloud Infrastructure Platforms to provide robust, reliable and cost-efficient Platform so that we can deliver the best experience for our growing customers base.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Primary Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Architect and build a robust, scalable and stable infrastructure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Architect and build Infrastructure that is easily maintainable during patching and upgrades without downtime&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Architect and build Infrastructure with AWS regional level failure tolerance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work together with our Security Engineers to provision a secure Infrastructure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Automations for AWS Deployments to ensure fast delivery of Cloud Services to our developers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide through Automations means for developers to easily deploy resources on AWS&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Tech Stack&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;AWS:&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;VPC, EC2, ECS, EKS, Lambda, Cloudfront, MWAA, RDS, ElastiCache, DynamoDB, Opensearch, S3, CloudWatch, Cognito, SQS, KMS, Secret Manager, KMS, MSK, SES, Transfer Family, ClientVPN, Shield, WAF, GuardDuty, IAM Identity Center, Organization, WorkSpaces, CodeCommit, CodeBuild, CodeDeploy, CodePipeline, CloudFormation and other services&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Terraform, Github Actions, Prometheus, Grafana, Atlantis, ArgoCD, OpenTelemetry, Wiz, &lt;em&gt;Backstage&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Qualifications&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;More than 5 years of technical and architectural experience in AWS-based infrastructure platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive technical hands-on experience with computing, networking, storage, and analytical services on Latest AWS Services&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Terraform based infrastructure as code (IAC) on AWS&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in production level infrastructure change management and releases for high traffic &amp;amp; business-critical systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in Cloud infrastructure and platform systems availability, performance and cost management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience as an AWS administrator, including Multi AWS organization management, managing 50+ AWS accounts and 100+ users&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of cloud security best practices in Fintech Industry&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated skill in programming and scripting languages, including Python, Shell Scripting, Go, and Rust&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent oral, written, and interpersonal communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in either English or Japanese&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
