&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Description&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; text-align: left; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: pre-wrap; text-decoration: none;&quot;&gt;We are working to provide the best financial services to users in Japan. We empower PayPay product by realizing efficient, stable and optimized storage services.&lt;br&gt;PayPay is looking for Cloud Platform Engineers who specialize in databases at scale on mission critical systems.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Main Responsibilities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
