&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Database operations, including monitoring, configuration management, upgrade, scaling, backup, and data migration.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Iterate on database operations to improve quality and efficiency&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Troubleshoot stability and performance problems&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Contribute to documentation for communicating knowledge, experience and for effective decision-making&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Research and test new tools in database ecosystems, and adopt them in PayPay Group.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Tech Stack&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;| Python, Shell, Go, SQL, PL/SQL &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;| Aurora, MySQL, PostgreSQL, TiDB, Redis, Valkey, DynamoDB &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;| AWS &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;| GitHub, Terraform, Jenkins, Ansible, Flyway &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;| Victoria Metrics, Grafana, Prometheus &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;| Slack, Zoom, Jira, Confluence &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Qualifications&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
