&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;img style=&quot;max-width: 100%;&quot; src=&quot;https://i.imgur.com/IsRPknQ.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; width=&quot;300&quot;&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;col-sm-9 col-12 content&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;col-sm-9 col-12 content&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About PayPay / PayPayについて&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;col-sm-9 col-12 content&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;PayPay is a FinTech company that has grown to over 75M (as of August 2026) users since its launch in 2018. Our team is hugely diverse with members from over 50 different countries.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;OUR VISION IS UNLIMITED_&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We dare to believe that we do not need a clear vision to create a future beyond our imagination. PayPay will always stay true to our roots and realize a vision (future) that no one else can imagine by constantly taking risks and challenging ourselves. With this mindset, you will be presented with new and exciting opportunities on a daily basis and have the opportunity to grow and reach new dimensions that you could never have imagined. We are looking for people who can embrace this challenge, refresh the product at breakneck speed and promote PayPay with professionalism and passion.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;※ Please note that you cannot apply or be selected in parallel with PayPay Corporation, PayPay Card Corporation and PayPay Securities Corporation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;2018年にサービスを開始してから約8年でユーザー数7500万人を突破したフィンテック企業であるPayPayは約50か国の国と地域から集まった多様なメンバーで構成されています。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;OUR VISION IS UNLIMITED_&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;我々は自分たちの想像を超える未来を創るためにあえて明確なビジョンは必要ないと考えています。常にDay1であるスタンスを忘れずに、誰もが想像できないようなビジョン（未来）を実現していくのがPayPayです。&lt;br&gt;この壮大なビジョンに前向きに取り組み、他社に真似できない圧倒的なスピードでプロダクトを磨き上げ、日本のキャッシュレス決済、またそれを使用した金融ライフプラットフォームとしての普及を一気に推進することにプロフェッショナルとして情熱を持って取り組み、自ら課題発見し、周囲と協力して新しい価値創出を共に推進する仲間を募集します。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;※ PayPay株式会社へご応募いただく際にはPayPayカード株式会社、PayPay証券株式会社へ併願応募はご遠慮いただいております。ご了承ください。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;col-sm-9 col-12 content&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;col-sm-9 col-12 content&quot;&gt;&lt;iframe src=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/embed/hwHBs9V_a4I?si=p-tFLv6DVVsnjCKv&quot; width=&quot;301&quot; height=&quot;169&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;iframe src=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/embed/DxDjFTeyYaU&quot; width=&quot;301&quot; height=&quot;169&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team Missions&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The PayPay Product Team aims to go beyond QR code payments, using payment functionality as a starting point to find new ways to make everyday life easier and deliver greater value to our users.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Every word in the PayPay app plays an important role in shaping the user experience. We are looking for a UX Writer to join our team and work closely with designers to create products that put the user experience first.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job description&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a member of the UX Writing Team, you will create, proofread, and propose clear, user-friendly English UX copy for the PayPay app. You will collaborate closely with engineers, product managers, designers, and other stakeholders to improve the overall user experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will work alongside other UX writers, with support from the UX Writing Team Lead and Manager.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Main Responsibilities&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;・Write clear and concise English microcopy that follows our voice and tone and writing guidelines&lt;br&gt;・Collaborate with designers, product managers, stakeholders, and other UX writers to improve UI copy and user flows&lt;br&gt;・Maintain consistency across products by contributing to and improving our writing guidelines&lt;br&gt;・Identify opportunities to improve UX writing processes and workflows, including through the use of AI&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;The Experiences You Will Gain&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;・Work on a diverse range of features and develop a uniquely comprehensive knowledge of the product and its many experiences&lt;br&gt;・Be a pioneer of UX writing in Japan leading in the industry&lt;br&gt;・Work with a team of UX writers&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Required Skills&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;・Native-level English proficiency, with the ability to write clear and natural English copy&lt;br&gt;・Strong Japanese communication skills, both written and spoken, with sufficient proficiency to discuss detailed and nuanced topics with team members&lt;br&gt;・Either A or B below:&lt;br&gt;A: Japanese to English translation (3 years minimum), or Japanese to English localization (2 years minimum)&lt;br&gt;B: UX or content writing experience in English (2 years minimum)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Preferred Skills&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;・Basic knowledge about websites and mobile apps (iOS/Android)&lt;br&gt;・Basic user flow and UI design knowledge&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;PayPay 5 senses&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Please refer &lt;a href=&quot;https://speakerdeck.com/paypaycorporation/e1f1b5f41d8b3b6f7982ed4ca7619d58&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;PayPay 5 senses &lt;/a&gt;to learn what we value at work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;待遇・条件&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h4 id=&quot;id-待遇・条件の記載方法-雇用形態&quot;&gt;雇用形態&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
