&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://insideout.paypay.ne.jp/en/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;PayPay Inside-out (Corporate Blog) /ENG&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
